<title>UK: BayerLB sets 1.0 bln French franc bond. [CORRECTED 16:36 GMT]</title>
<headline>BayerLB sets 1.0 bln French franc bond. [CORRECTED 16:36 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Banque Lehman Brothers.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BAYERISCHE LANDESBANK GIROZENTRALE</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN FFR   COUPON  ** 4.00	MATURITY    26.MAR.07 (Corrects)</p>
<p> TYPE   TEC-10 LINKED ISS PRICE  101.00    PAY DATE    26.MAR.97 (Corrects)</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.325     REOFFER    100.00</p>
<p> NOTES   ** YEARS 1-3, THEN TEC-10 MINUS 98 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    PARIS     PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (M) ONE	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/FR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.325     SELL CONC  1.00	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
